  If you use the pfSense Telegram Monitoring Suite in your research,
  publications, teaching, or projects, please cite it using the metadata
  provided below.

title: "pfSense Telegram Monitoring Suite"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Moga"
    given-names: "Dhrumil"
    affiliation: "Independent Developer"

abstract: >
  A lightweight, modular monitoring suite for pfSense that provides
  real-time Telegram notifications for system health, WireGuard VPN,
  firewall activity, Suricata IDS alerts, service monitoring,
  configuration changes, and automated reporting.

